				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-12332607#post-4592487</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-12332607/ooo-ooo-ooo-ooo-ooo-ooo-ooo#post-4592487</link>
				<description></description>
